    "description": "穆斯林日常功修助手：礼拜时间（含倒计时与提醒）、引导式记念与赞珠、伊斯兰历与节日、斋戒提醒、朝向（Qibla）、真主九十九尊名、祈祷词等。开源、免费、无需账号、完全离线。界面支持印尼语、英语和中文。\n\nDaily worship companion for Muslims: prayer times with countdown and alerts, guided dhikr and tasbih, Hijri calendar and holidays, fasting reminders, Qibla, Asmaul Husna, duas and more. Open source, free, no account, fully offline. Available in Indonesian, English and Chinese.\n\n社区制作的 Vela 快应用，非小米官方产品。Community quick app, not an official Xiaomi product.",
